Exact VAM projection (ANALYSIS 45, 2026-10-13): prototype, NOT merged.  The pressure residual
is the constraint (press at dt = 0) of the corrected state, plus the runtime items it needs.
Base: core 6cbf885, jax 4b2ce3f, foam 250b152, amrex 0270878 (dev/vam-projection); one diff per
library, each applied in its own checkout from the superrepo root:
  P=$PWD/docs/dev/symbolic_solver/prototype/exact_projection.patch
  git -C library/zoomy_core  apply --include='zoomy_core/*' $P
  git -C library/zoomy_jax   apply --include='zoomy_jax/*' $P
  git -C library/zoomy_foam  apply --include='symsolver/*' $P
  git -C library/zoomy_amrex apply --include='Source/*' $P

